menu "e32p: bmp280"

    config E32P_BMP280_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_bmp280 (Bosch BMP280 pressure/temperature sensor)"
        select E32P_I2C_ENABLE
        default n
        help
            Driver for the Bosch BMP280 pressure + temperature sensor over
            e32p_i2c. The Bosch compensation math (datasheet §3.11.3) is kept as
            pure functions so it is unit-testable headless against the datasheet
            reference vector; the thin I2C layer probes the chip id, reads the
            factory calibration, applies oversampling/filter/mode, and burst-reads
            samples. Selecting this pulls in e32p_i2c.

endmenu
